        {
          "address": "0x1410b7ff0",
          "from": "0x140533a9e",
          "text": "Toggle between editing generators and nodes.  Nodes are individual parts of the tree (like a leaf\nor a branch).  Generators are groups of nodes that represent a section of the model. Most editing\nshould be done on the generators to efficiently control large portions of the model.  Switch to editing\nnodes to fine tune the model before exporting.\n\nHot key: Tab"
