        },
        {
          "address": "0x1410b7f10",
          "from": "0x140533c00",
          "text": "All property edits apply to the selected node(s).  Property edits in this mode are offsets to the\nthe value computed by the generator and should be used for fine tuning only.\n\nHot key: Tab"
